# HybridReverb Version Build Plan

- Before every commit, update the HybridReverb plugin version in `CMakeLists.txt`:
  `set(HYBRIDREVJO_VERSION x.y)`
- Treat `HYBRIDREVJO_VERSION` as the single source of truth for the plugin version.
- `Source/PluginEditor.cpp` displays that value with `ProjectInfo::versionString`, so the UI version changes when the JUCE header is regenerated by the build.
- When preparing a commit, check that the version shown in the plugin editor behavior matches the intended new `HYBRIDREVJO_VERSION`.
